# Generated from the live OpenAPI document by `npm run api:types`.
#
# linguist-generated collapses the file in pull request diffs and keeps it out of the
# repository language statistics. It is 4200 lines the compiler reads and nobody edits;
# without this, every contract change produces a diff that buries the real one.
#
# It is still committed and still diffable on purpose — CI regenerates it and fails the
# build when the committed copy has drifted from what the server publishes.
api/generated/schema.d.ts linguist-generated=true

# Keep line endings sane across the Windows/Linux split this project is developed on.
* text=auto eol=lf
